WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.276
Day 4. Another team, for a sound your child knows.

2
00:00:03.726 --> 00:00:10.538
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:11.038 --> 00:00:14.975
Here is today's team. Listen. Two letters make this one sound.

4
00:00:16.793 --> 00:00:23.548
It is the long sound your child knows from boat. This team has a second sound too. It comes on day nine.

5
00:00:27.559 --> 00:00:28.593
The word is snow.

6
00:00:33.074 --> 00:00:34.086
The word is slow.

7
00:00:34.986 --> 00:00:39.542
The words to say to your child are in the yellow box at the top. Read them out.

8
00:00:39.992 --> 00:00:44.516
Read the first row of job one together. Your child reads the second row.

9
00:00:44.966 --> 00:00:48.999
If a word goes wrong, do not say it. Say the same words every time.

10
00:00:49.449 --> 00:00:52.352
Find the team. What sound does it make? Then wait.

11
00:00:53.152 --> 00:00:58.725
For job two, press play for your child and step away. The voice waits, then says each word.

12
00:00:59.175 --> 00:01:02.638
At the end, your child reads three words to you. Mark each one.
